  "oneLinerQuestion": "Find how many days you have to wait for a warmer temperature for each day in an array.",
  "url": "https://leetcode.com/problems/daily-temperatures/",
  "explanation": "Use a monotonic decreasing stack storing indices. When encountering a warmer temperature, pop smaller indices and calculate difference in index position.",
  "pseudoCode": "FUNCTION dailyTemperatures(temperatures):\n    res = ARRAY_OF_SIZE(LENGTH(temperatures), 0), stack = EMPTY_STACK()\n    FOR i, t IN ENUMERATE(temperatures) DO:\n        WHILE stack AND t > TOP(stack).temp DO:\n            [stackT, stackInd] = POP(stack)\n            res[stackInd] = i - stackInd\n        END WHILE\n        PUSH [t, i] TO stack\n    END FOR\n    RETURN res\nEND FUNCTION",
